# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ALLOWLIST. This repository holds the rhkb tool and nothing else.
#
# Everything is ignored by default; only the files listed under "Allowed" are
# tracked. Fetched documentation (raw/), the compiled wiki (wiki/), ingest state,
# briefs, chat exports, customer notes, .env files and editor/agent state are
# therefore never picked up by `git add`, whatever they are called or wherever
# they are put.
#
# Private data belongs in a workspace OUTSIDE this directory (RHKB_HOME, see
# README). If you need to track a new kind of file, add it to the allowlist
# below on purpose.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Ignore everything...
*

# ...but let git look inside directories (files in them stay ignored unless
# allowed below).
!*/

# --------------------------------- Allowed ---------------------------------
# Project files
!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/pyproject.toml
!/requirements.txt
!/sources.yaml

# The tool and its tests: Python source only
!/rhkb/**/*.py
!/tests/**/*.py

# CI and git hooks
!/.github/workflows/*.yml
!/.githooks/*
